# This path is not part of the site.
#
# /.assetsignore is not published by this deployment, and this file exists only
# to hold the path. The file it used to serve listed the repository files a
# deploy must not upload, and the project's first Pages deployment - which
# uploaded the repository root - served it. The site then moved into public/ and
# that file was deleted; the edge kept serving this copy anyway (measured
# 14 Oct 2026: 200 with CF-Cache-Status: HIT and Age ~42,000s, while the same
# path with any query string answered 404). Pages retains removed assets.
#
# The rules it held are the publish set itself now - the directory Pages uploads
# is public/ - and the repository's README says so.
